\uc2  that keeps much of its yen-selling activity from showing up in government data, some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders say. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030708dz780177o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
