\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar static pre-Fed, BOJ talk a temporary relief. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Natsuko Waki \par \uc2 556 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juni 2003\par 14:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, June 25 (Reuters) - The dollar shuttled in tight ranges off recent five-week highs on the euro on Wednesday as investors nervously awaited a U.S. interest rate move, but it pared losses on the yen on wariness of Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on whether the monetary authorities had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market after the dollar rose about half a yen in a matter of minutes earlier in Europe, sparking talk of official involvement. \par \par \uc2  The market's preoccupation with the outcome of the Federal Reserve's highly uncertain decision at 1815 GMT meant an uptick in Germany's Ifo business sentiment index gave little fresh fuel to the euro aside from a brief, initial uptick on the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "There is an unusual sense of disorientation in the market," said Aziz McMahon, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at ABN Amro. \par \par \uc2  "A large number of macroeconomic forces are being digested... and the market wants some clarity. There was talk of BOJ (Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but the market focus is on the Fed." \par \par \uc2  By 1145 GMT, the dollar was slightly lower against the euro at $1.1530 having hit five-week highs of $1.1475 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Against the yen, the dollar was down a third of a percent from late New York levels at 117.50, after a sudden jump of half a yen to 117.80 earlier. \par \par \uc2  "We see a couple of Japanese names buying (dollar/yen) and a (U.S. investment bank) out of Tokyo. The BOJ is trying to stem Hthe tide," a European bank trader in London said when the yen was falling. \par \par \uc2  In Asia, the yen was rising on the dollar due to demand from Japanese exporters trying to meet end-month obligations, until it suddenly reversed course. \par \par \uc2  Japanese monetary authorities have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market covertly to limit the yen's rise over the past few months in a bid to protect the competitiveness of the export-reliant economy. \par \par \uc2  Norway's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut benchmark rates by 100 basis points to four percent, signalling a continued easing bias for interest rates. It also cut its overnight lending rate to six percent from seven. \par \par \uc2  The crown was steady on the decision and was staying off recent two-month lows against the dollar and two-year lows against the euro. \par \par \uc2  THE GREAT DEBATE \par \par \uc2  Not only are expectations split whether the Fed will ease by 25 or 50 basis points when it announces its rate decision later but implications for the dollar are also unclear. \par \par \uc2  Some analysts expect the greenback to draw support from a growth-boosting cut while others see it falling on a greater yield disadvantage. \par \par \uc2  "Expectations are evenly divided. Assuming a 50 basis points cut is bad and 25 is good for the dollar seems overly simplistic because what's going to come out of the statement will be more important," said Steven Pearson, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Halifax Bank of Scotland Treasury Services. \par \par \uc2  The German Ifo institute's closely-watched business climate index rose to 88.8 in June from May's 87.6, beating analysts' expectations. \par \par \uc2  U.S. stock futures are pointing to a slightly higher open on Wall Street after eking out gains on Tuesday on hopes for an economic recovery. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030625dz6p00o8h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
