\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Japan FX intervention \highlight\uc2  hits monthly high. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Chikafumi Hodo \par \uc2 751 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 2003\par 13:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, May 30 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted the largest ever monthly volume of yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in May, Japanese officials confirmed on Friday, with the action aimed at stemming the yen's rise to benefit the nation's exporters. \par \par \uc2  Japan's yen-selling totalled about 3.9825 trillion yen ($33.70 billion) - a record single month figure - in May after refraining from conducting \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the previous month, Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) data showed on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers believe Japan wants to keep the dollar from falling below the crucial 115 yen mark, the level which is believed to be the break-even point for exporters. \par \par \uc2  "The amount was in line with expectations, but still very big. It shows the determination of Japanese authorities," said Junya Tanase global markets officer at JP Morgan Chase in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  "An interesting element is that it seems the Japanese authorities did not budge even after U.S. Treasury Secretary (John) Snow made some negative comments about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  At 1047 GMT, the dollar was quoted at 118.70 yen after slipping to a two-year low of 115.10 on May 19. \par \par \uc2  "The amount of yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was close to that of the BOJ data," a \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) official, speaking on condition of anonymity, told a small group of reporters. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ data showed that the MOF paid the amount to the private sector through its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account, which mostly represents \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The MOF declined comment on which \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  the Japanese authorities bought and on which days they conducted the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The BOJ, which acts as an agent of the MOF, did not conduct \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in April, but it sold the yen heavily during the January-March period to keep the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down. \par \par \uc2  During the three-month \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  campaign, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent a total of 2.39 trillion yen, selling the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on 17 occasions, the MOF said earlier in the month. \par \par \uc2  SHOWING RESULTS \par \par \uc2  The dollar remains fragile on continued hints by U.S. officials that they want or at least will tolerate a weaker dollar. \par \par \uc2  The market was also sceptical that the United States was abiding by its strong dollar policy despite affirmation by President George W. Bush. \par \par \uc2  Addressing concerns about the sharp fall in the dollar's value, Bush was quoted as saying in an interview with French newspaper Le Figaro on Thursday that Washington was conducting policies favourable to a strong dollar. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, San Francisco Federal Reserve President Robert Parry said that the continuing fall in the dollar would likely boost the U.S. economy. \par \par \uc2  But the greenback has been supported against the yen as Japan's actions finally appear to be showing some effect by keeping speculators from driving the dollar below 115 yen. \par \par \uc2  "As the authorities showed a distinct willingness to protect 115 yen, the market is now very careful about building new short positions below 116 yen," said Hideaki Furumaya, head of the interbank desk at Trust and Custody Services Bank. \par \par \uc2  "But the market still believes that \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not be conducted in a manner that will sharply drive the dollar above 120 yen. So plenty of sellers are lining up offers near 120." \par \par \uc2  DESPERATE AUTHORITIES \par \par \uc2  Some dealers suspect Tokyo stepped in as recently as Tuesday, when the dollar fell to around 116.20 yen in post-Asian trade. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  is believed to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in the past two weeks, and this was thought to be stopping the dollar from falling below 115 yen, dealers said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market sources said they suspect the BOJ may have initially \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on May 8 during this month's campaign when the dollar rapidly lost ground to around 116 yen from around 119. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily when the greenback dipped to a two-year low of 115.10 yen on May 19 during London and New York trading hours. \par \par \uc2  "Looking at the volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , I can understand how the dollar/yen managed to hold around levels seen at the start of the month, while the dollar fell sharply across the board," said a senior trader at a major Japanese bank. \par \par \uc2  "Without the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , I feel that the dollar would be down all the way below 110 yen by now," he said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar has dropped about eight percent against the euro in the last month, tumbling to a record low around $1.1935 earlier in the week. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030530dz5u00n02\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
