\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange \highlight\uc2  Account Balance Rose Y3.983T In May \b0\par\par\uc2 330 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 2003\par 12:15\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- The Bank of Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account expanded by Y3.983 trillion in May, indicating what traders had suspected - that Japanese authorities quietly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in what was likely record amounts to stem the yen's rise this month. \par \par \uc2  Market participants had speculated the BOJ, on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , covertly sold more than Y4 trillion against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  over a number of days this month. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ and MOF have so far declined to confirm the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar was at its lowest this month on May 19 when it touched Y115.10 - its weakest level for 27 months. But later that day, the dollar regained Y2 on what traders speculate was the BOJ's heaviest bout of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in May. \par \par \uc2  At 1018 GMT Friday, the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted at Y118.69. \par \par \uc2  The previous record monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  total was Y3.21 trillion in September 2001, according to an analyst. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ's data for April showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , likely because the yen was relatively stable around Y120. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold more than Y2 trillion between January and March to stem the yen's rapid appreciation against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But on each occasion the authorities wouldn't confirm the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  until the end of each month. In \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  is responsible for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ's data are included in a table that measures changes in the balances of current accounts at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The change in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account reflects transactions between private-sector financial institutions and the account. \par \par \uc2  The data doesn't completely correlate with exact timings of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the MOF and also includes \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions related to the government's activities outside Japan such as funding for embassies. \par \par \uc2  -By Michiyo Seki and Yoshio Takahashi, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; michiyo.seki@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030530dz5u000nv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
