\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: Mkt Awaits Fri BOJ Data On  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 354 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 2003\par 08:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Some market players also mentioned the possibility that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's finance ministry, via the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , quietly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again overnight and on Thursday to help the dollar advance. The government is widely believed to have been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly this month to help support the dollar and to keep the yen from rising too far. \par \par \uc2  Although ministry officials have neither confirmed or denied the speculation, market players will be watching Friday's release of BOJ data on the sources of change in its monthly current account, which will effectively confirm the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by revealing the amount of money the government has spent in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market this month. \par \par \uc2  Even though the dollar advanced Thursday, Tokyo traders speculate the finance ministry will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  indefinitely, to prevent the yen from rising, if the dollar shows signs of slipping again. \par \par \uc2  "Their aim is to discourage those who want to sell dollars by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  again and again and again," Ogino said. \par \par \uc2  UFJ's Tate added the recent unwinding of dollar shorts was due in part to speculators giving up on holding on to such positions in the face of such strong government resolve to cap the yen. \par \par \uc2  The euro remained subdued against the dollar, continuing its correction from recent gains. \par \par \uc2  Some traders said selling to protect options barriers at $1.2000, as well as uncertainty ahead of the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  meeting on June 5, were keeping the euro from regaining lost ground. \par \par \uc2  Some are expecting the bank to cut interest rates by 0.25 percentage point, though others are looking at the possibility of 0.50 percentage point cut. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    -By Miyako Takebe, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929;\par miyako.takebe@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -Edited by Kirsty Mackenzie\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The chart of late Tokyo \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates that accompanied Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has\par been replaced with an enhanced \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fixture that is updated\par hourly.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Subscribers can find this table:\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Telerate pages 4046 and 1087.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Dow Jones Newswires by searching the code N/IFX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Reuters by entering FRX or INT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Bloomberg by entering NI FRX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030529dz5t000dd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
